      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَفْدِينٌ</span></b>  signifies The <i>making</i> a building <i>tall.</i>
(K. [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَدَنٌ</span>.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And (tropical:)  The <i>fattening</i> of
camels. (K, TA.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فدّنهُ</span>, meaning (tropical:)  <i>He</i>
(the pastor) <i>fattened him</i> [i. e. a camel]; <i>made
him like the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَدَن</span>, i. e. <i>the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصْر</span>. (TA.)

